":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cRW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3af0e2db-b3a9-4c30-b458-c2a4e4e6e31a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"まぁこのサイズのファイル開くのってほぼ100%誤爆なので、すぐバッファごと消すから運用上はおそらく問題ない","ts":"1630030861.028600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"65u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"185eb618-cad1-4314-bbf1-d6ca63719f84","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ので毎回global書き換えるしかないのではという最悪な感じになってます","ts":"1630030815.027900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2klrh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39c10961-4e18-46cb-8765-223a9f995694","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```autocmd BufReadPre * call \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;test()\nfunction! s:test() abort\n  let fsize = getfsize(@%)\n  if fsize \u0026gt; 500000\n    TSBufDisable highlight\n    TSBufDisable context_commentstring\n    TSBufDisable rainbow\n  endif\nendfunction```\nこれで死んだ","ts":"1630030780.027600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8/jKT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19838c0d-30ad-49ce-8ea1-2a87e5047043","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あー確かに`TSBufDisable`してもparseされちゃってますね(速度が変わらない)","ts":"1630030771.027400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TayVs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40206810-a993-4ff1-9bfc-51b4b21330d2","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"有効化してるとバッファ開くのが遅くなる","ts":"1630030697.026600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fUW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2749f00b-b182-4011-83f4-c5a63eb244e6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"多分非同期動作はしてないはず","ts":"1630030687.026300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_tex