e","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`syntax off | setlocal syntax=off | syntax on`\nでsyntax有効になっちゃいません？","ts":"1630030528.023100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cv2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"934f00e5-cc3c-425a-9c08-6f4820a28f8d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"BufEnterで毎回globalな設定を書き換えてるのあまりにも気持ち悪い","ts":"1630030350.022100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RvZk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"025a0357-5f11-4d0d-a96d-ae8ee0bb28b9","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"syntaxの方は `setlocal syntax=off` を試したんですけど、syntax onになった瞬間にsyntax=offが外れるみたいな挙動になってしまって","ts":"1630030241.021100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"za6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6f7bacf-9bdd-4e67-89f0-f310f8960851","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"BufEnterの場合はもちろん","ts":"1630030182.020100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8KSf2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5faa45e-8bec-4957-ba8b-4909c4411c51","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"BufReadPreとかでも多分EnableAllだとtreesitterが読みにいってる気がするんですよね","ts":"1630030170.019800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zgc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d39ff480-4ad2-427d-b0c8-0bed4c840702","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あ、そうじゃなくてBufEnterでtreesitterが起動するってことか","ts":"1630030101.018900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bEecS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71e13c49-eefe-47cf-8d7a-0b5c5d9e0d6a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"バッファローカル変数でも仕込んで回避したらよさそう","ts":"1630030078.018600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5CwX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6819a886-9795-4905-80ce-7672b9ce90c9","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"問題は間違えてクソでかファイルを開いた瞬間はこれで回避できるけど、そのあと間違えて別ウィンドウに飛んだときとかにBufEnterが発火してクソでかファイルにhighlightが適用されてしまう・・・","ts":"1630029712.018300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cGNhq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e13d4e85-a8c6-497d-af6d-218fba1beb4a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"絶対何か違うと思うけどこれで（大体）目的は果たしました\n```autocmd BufReadPre,BufEnter * call \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;set_syntax()\n\nfunction! s:set_syntax() abort\n  syntax off\n  TSDisableAll highlight\n  TSDisableAll context_commentstring\n  TSDisableAll rainbow\n\n  let fsize = getfsize(@%)\n  if \u0026amp;ft ==# \"\" || fsize \u0026lt;= 0\n    return\n  endif\n\n  if fsize \u0026lt; 500000\n    syntax on\n    TSEnableAll highlight\n    TSEnableAll context_commentstring\n    TSEnableAll rainbow\n  endif\nendfunction```","ts":"1630029625.017300","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1630030333.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"phGSc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c1d28af-9b0b-470c-8f1f-d8bd77691e27","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```autocmd FileType * call \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;disable_syntax()\nfunction! s:disable_syntax() abort\n  setlocal syntax=off\nendfunction```\nこれですら効かない・・・？","ts":"1630026676.016900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bPR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10388c78-a36e-40c0-9571-05b3ed12e790","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"せめてasyncでファイル読んでくれたら固まらなくていいんだけどなー","ts":"1630026608.016400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X9e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79d023f5-e56f-44bb-b339-46d088d6d6e4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```autocmd BufReadPre * call \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;enable_syntax()\n\nfunction! s:enable_syntax() abort\n  if getfsize(@%) \u0026lt; 1000000\n    setlocal syntax=on\n    TSBufEnable highlight\n    TSBufEnable context_commentstring\n    TSBufEnable rainbow\n  else\n    TSDisableAll highlight\n    TSDisableAll context_commentstring\n    TSDisableAll rainbow\n  endif\nendfunction```\nこれでもなんか動いてくれない・・・","ts":"1630026365.016100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l+/t8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c486e2b-4dec-4c83-bca0-fbd35d2a2c65","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```autocmd FileType typescript,typescriptreact,javascript call \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;enable_syntax()\nautocmd VimEnter * call \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;disable_treesitter()\n\nfunction! s:enable_syntax() abort\n  if getfsize(@%) \u0026lt; 1000000\n    setlocal syntax=on\n    TSBufEnable highlight\n    TSBufEnable context_commentstring\n    TSBufEnable rainbow\n  endif\nendfunction\n\nfunction! s:disable_treesitter() abort\n  TSDisableAll highlight\n  TSDisableAll context_commentstring\n  TSDisableAll rainbow\nendfunction```\nうーん、DisableAllがBufEnableより優先度高いみたい","ts":"1630026174.015500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qwFW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"618342f9-6867-477c-82bf-2965e84c9fbe","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ファイルサイズの取得っていうかファイルパスか","ts":"1630025417.014900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ITIHS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1249b2a8-e0aa-4e83-8139-8686b63ce619","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"BufReadPreでファイルサイズの取得ってできるんですかね？","ts":"1630025370.014700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rsF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5ccac09-db66-48be-8066-3a664018c3c1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"むしろ基本offにしておいてファイルサイズを見て有効化する方がいい？","ts":"1630025317.014400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":fal